        "created_at": "2015-01-01T16:49:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"xThe Killswitch\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n xThe Killswitch:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You mean like if Legacy uses Takedown vs. Baron Blade?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I think that's what he means.&nbsp; Or Flying Smash against a Mobile Defense Platform. Or if a Platform Bot damages Baron Blade!</p>\n<p>Tangentially, I was amused during a recent game in the Realm of Discord when I realized that BB's Living Force Field was actually alive (at least temporarily).</p>",
